flowchart TB
    iPhone[iPhone]
    
    iPhone --> Terminus[Terminus<br/>SSH + tunnels + shell]
    iPhone --> Safari[Safari<br/>HTTP UI]
    iPhone --> PGOrbit[PG Orbit<br/>DB client]
    
    Safari -.->|http://localhost:5678<br/>through local tunnel| LocalN8N[Local Port 5678]
    PGOrbit -.->|connects to<br/>localhost:5432| LocalPG[Local Port 5432]
    
    Terminus -->|SSH key-based auth<br/>with local port forwards:<br/>5678 → VPS:5678<br/>5432 → VPS:5432| VPS[VPS / Hetzner]
    
    LocalN8N -.->|tunneled to| VPS
    LocalPG -.->|tunneled to| VPS
    
    VPS --> N8N[Docker: n8n<br/>listens on localhost:5678]
    VPS --> Postgres[Docker: Postgres<br/>hvac-postgres<br/>listens on localhost:5432]
    
    Postgres --> Volume[Named volume:<br/>hvac-postgres-data<br/>future: backup container/pg_dump]
    
    style iPhone fill:#e1f5ff
    style VPS fill:#fff4e1
    style N8N fill:#e8f5e9
    style Postgres fill:#e8f5e9
    style Volume fill:#f3e5f5
    style Terminus fill:#fff9e1
    style Safari fill:#fff9e1
    style PGOrbit fill:#fff9e1